{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "你有没有过这种经历，一段旋律只听一遍。", "t0": 676613.370414, "t1": 676618.259575, "dur_ms": 4889.16, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:38:59", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 1.02], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.99], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.03], ["s5_infer", 4816.22], ["s6_guard", 4816.96], ["s7_save_wav", 4825.83], ["s8_write_cache", 4841.25], ["s9_vram", 4842.92], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4842.94], ["l2_named_copy", 4865.38], ["l3_progress_cb", 4889.15]], "audio_ms": 4080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "然后就甩不掉了，走路都在哼。", "t0": 676618.261354, "t1": 676623.57644, "dur_ms": 5315.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:04", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.8], ["s3_tmpdir", 25.34], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 25.38], ["s5_infer", 5267.34], ["s6_guard", 5268.08], ["s7_save_wav", 5272.74], ["s8_write_cache", 5291.16], ["s9_vram", 5291.83], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5291.85], ["l2_named_copy", 5313.7], ["l3_progress_cb", 5315.08]], "audio_ms": 4600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "今天就想聊聊，它为什么这么黏人。", "t0": 676623.597823, "t1": 676627.723566, "dur_ms": 4125.74, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:08", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.75], ["s3_tmpdir", 21.47], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 21.51], ["s5_infer", 4074.54], ["s6_guard", 4075.25], ["s7_save_wav", 4079.59], ["s8_write_cache", 4099.5], ["s9_vram", 4100.34], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4100.36], ["l2_named_copy", 4124.32], ["l3_progress_cb", 4125.74]], "audio_ms": 3400, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 15, "text": "我先给个结论，重复是头号功臣。", "t0": 676627.744192, "t1": 676633.190885, "dur_ms": 5446.69, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:14", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 1.09], ["s3_tmpdir", 2.01], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.05], ["s5_infer", 5388.14], ["s6_guard", 5388.83], ["s7_save_wav", 5393.78], ["s8_write_cache", 5417.2], ["s9_vram", 5417.96], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5417.98], ["l2_named_copy", 5445.27], ["l3_progress_cb", 5446.69]], "audio_ms": 4840, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 11, "text": "可重复多了不是会腻吗？", "t0": 676633.212546, "t1": 676638.251506, "dur_ms": 5038.96, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:19", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 1.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 2.43], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.48], ["s5_infer", 4989.23], ["s6_guard", 4989.92], ["s7_save_wav", 4994.76], ["s8_write_cache", 5014.72], ["s9_vram", 5015.59], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5015.61], ["l2_named_copy", 5037.54], ["l3_progress_cb", 5038.96]], "audio_ms": 4240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "关键在间隔，隔一会儿再回来。", "t0": 676638.272536, "t1": 676643.186324, "dur_ms": 4913.79, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:24", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.83], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.63], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.67], ["s5_infer", 4863.39], ["s6_guard", 4864.09], ["s7_save_wav", 4869.28], ["s8_write_cache", 4889.23], ["s9_vram", 4889.9], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4889.92], ["l2_named_copy", 4912.36], ["l3_progress_cb", 4913.78]], "audio_ms": 4360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 11, "text": "也就是说，别一次听满。", "t0": 676643.207171, "t1": 676646.83676, "dur_ms": 3629.59, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:27", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.73], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.89], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.93], ["s5_infer", 3580.16], ["s6_guard", 3581.03], ["s7_save_wav", 3585.77], ["s8_write_cache", 3605.37], ["s9_vram", 3606.05], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3606.07], ["l2_named_copy", 3627.84], ["l3_progress_cb", 3629.58]], "audio_ms": 2960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 13, "text": "对，大脑喜欢能猜到的东西。", "t0": 676646.856532, "t1": 676651.972122, "dur_ms": 5115.59, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:33", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.9], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.81], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.85], ["s5_infer", 5064.41], ["s6_guard", 5064.98], ["s7_save_wav", 5069.58], ["s8_write_cache", 5090.62], ["s9_vram", 5091.28], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5091.29], ["l2_named_copy", 5114.05], ["l3_progress_cb", 5115.59]], "audio_ms": 4400, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "A", "chars": 13, "text": "但完全猜到，好像又没意思。", "t0": 676651.993113, "t1": 676655.605233, "dur_ms": 3612.12, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:36", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.52], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.56], ["s5_infer", 3558.54], ["s6_guard", 3559.25], ["s7_save_wav", 3566.29], ["s8_write_cache", 3586.29], ["s9_vram", 3586.95], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3586.97], ["l2_named_copy", 3610.38], ["l3_progress_cb", 3612.11]], "audio_ms": 2960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "B", "chars": 10, "text": "所以要留一点小意外。", "t0": 676655.6264, "t1": 676667.926016, "dur_ms": 12299.62, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:48", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.75], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.63], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.67], ["s5_infer", 8567.18], ["s6_guard", 12245.41], ["s7_save_wav", 12253.48], ["s8_write_cache", 12275.26], ["s9_vram", 12275.92], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 12275.94], ["l2_named_copy", 12298.15], ["l3_progress_cb", 12299.61]], "audio_ms": 2960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 11, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "猜得到又猜不全，就格外抓人。", "t0": 676667.949342, "t1": 676672.951961, "dur_ms": 5002.62, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:53", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.7], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.72], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.76], ["s5_infer", 4954.08], ["s6_guard", 4954.72], ["s7_save_wav", 4959.71], ["s8_write_cache", 4977.96], ["s9_vram", 4978.61], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4978.63], ["l2_named_copy", 5001.02], ["l3_progress_cb", 5002.61]], "audio_ms": 4240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 12, "speaker": "B", "chars": 13, "text": "音高和节奏都在悄悄做预期。", "t0": 676672.971791, "t1": 676677.578723, "dur_ms": 4606.93, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:39:58", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.75], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.79], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.83], ["s5_infer", 4558.02], ["s6_guard", 4558.62], ["s7_save_wav", 4563.79], ["s8_write_cache", 4582.87], ["s9_vram", 4583.5], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4583.52], ["l2_named_copy", 4605.48], ["l3_progress_cb", 4606.93]], "audio_ms": 3920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 13, "speaker": "A", "chars": 12, "text": "那情绪的作用是不是更大？", "t0": 676677.598922, "t1": 676681.278077, "dur_ms": 3679.15, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:02", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.55], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.28], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.32], ["s5_infer", 3624.71], ["s6_guard", 3625.29], ["s7_save_wav", 3632.28], ["s8_write_cache", 3652.95], ["s9_vram", 3653.61], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3653.62], ["l2_named_copy", 3677.55], ["l3_progress_cb", 3679.15]], "audio_ms": 2960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 14, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "很大，情绪强的时候记忆更深。", "t0": 676681.29878, "t1": 676686.332766, "dur_ms": 5033.99, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:07", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.66], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.68], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.72], ["s5_infer", 4982.4], ["s6_guard", 4983.22], ["s7_save_wav", 4987.66], ["s8_write_cache", 5008.68], ["s9_vram", 5009.31], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5009.32], ["l2_named_copy", 5032.19], ["l3_progress_cb", 5033.98]], "audio_ms": 4320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 15, "speaker": "A", "chars": 13, "text": "所以副歌常放在情绪最高处。", "t0": 676686.354465, "t1": 676691.114729, "dur_ms": 4760.26, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:12", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.73], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.57], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.61], ["s5_infer", 4705.6], ["s6_guard", 4706.27], ["s7_save_wav", 4711.64], ["s8_write_cache", 4732.77], ["s9_vram", 4733.41], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4733.42], ["l2_named_copy", 4758.82], ["l3_progress_cb", 4760.26]], "audio_ms": 4320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 16, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "还有一点，旋律要容易跟着唱。", "t0": 676691.135141, "t1": 676695.527078, "dur_ms": 4391.94, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:16", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.76], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.74], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.79], ["s5_infer", 4342.64], ["s6_guard", 4343.3], ["s7_save_wav", 4347.66], ["s8_write_cache", 4367.33], ["s9_vram", 4368.18], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4368.19], ["l2_named_copy", 4390.48], ["l3_progress_cb", 4391.93]], "audio_ms": 3600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 17, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "音域窄、步子小，就更好上口。", "t0": 676695.550782, "t1": 676700.12038, "dur_ms": 4569.6, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:21", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.81], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.87], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.92], ["s5_infer", 4518.96], ["s6_guard", 4519.58], ["s7_save_wav", 4524.41], ["s8_write_cache", 4544.98], ["s9_vram", 4545.63], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4545.64], ["l2_named_copy", 4567.79], ["l3_progress_cb", 4569.59]], "audio_ms": 4040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 18, "speaker": "B", "chars": 13, "text": "不过太简单，也容易被忘掉。", "t0": 676700.139841, "t1": 676705.267057, "dur_ms": 5127.22, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:26", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.27], ["s3_tmpdir", 0.9], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 0.94], ["s5_infer", 5075.4], ["s6_guard", 5076.04], ["s7_save_wav", 5080.31], ["s8_write_cache", 5101.53], ["s9_vram", 5102.19], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5102.21], ["l2_named_copy", 5125.45], ["l3_progress_cb", 5127.21]], "audio_ms": 4480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 19, "speaker": "A", "chars": 13, "text": "得在熟悉和新鲜之间找平衡。", "t0": 676705.286801, "t1": 676709.363876, "dur_ms": 4077.08, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:30", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.45], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.49], ["s5_infer", 4028.43], ["s6_guard", 4029.08], ["s7_save_wav", 4033.56], ["s8_write_cache", 4052.6], ["s9_vram", 4053.28], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4053.3], ["l2_named_copy", 4075.48], ["l3_progress_cb", 4077.07]], "audio_ms": 3360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 20, "speaker": "B", "chars": 13, "text": "这个平衡很难刻意设计出来。", "t0": 676709.384616, "t1": 676713.250102, "dur_ms": 3865.49, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:34", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.21], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.25], ["s5_infer", 3818.01], ["s6_guard", 3818.72], ["s7_save_wav", 3824.19], ["s8_write_cache", 3841.71], ["s9_vram", 3842.34], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3842.36], ["l2_named_copy", 3864.01], ["l3_progress_cb", 3865.48]], "audio_ms": 3080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 21, "speaker": "A", "chars": 13, "text": "所以好旋律往往是碰出来的。", "t0": 676713.270589, "t1": 676718.203425, "dur_ms": 4932.84, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:39", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.64], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.71], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.76], ["s5_infer", 4884.66], ["s6_guard", 4885.28], ["s7_save_wav", 4890.32], ["s8_write_cache", 4909.11], ["s9_vram", 4910.04], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4910.06], ["l2_named_copy", 4931.34], ["l3_progress_cb", 4932.83]], "audio_ms": 4360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 22, "speaker": "B", "chars": 14, "text": "记住它，多半是记住了那一刻。", "t0": 676718.223592, "t1": 676722.882123, "dur_ms": 4658.53, "wall": "2026-09-18T11:40:43", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.42], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.54], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.58], ["s5_infer", 4605.73], ["s6_guard", 4606.42], ["s7_save_wav", 4613.97], ["s8_write_cache", 4633.98], ["s9_vram", 4635.07], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4635.4], ["l2_named_copy", 4657.09], ["l3_progress_cb", 4658.53]], "audio_ms": 4040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
